        "attribution": "Pfleiderer and Tokura made central experimental contributions to identifying and establishing skyrmions in chiral magnets and related materials.",
        "maturity": "Skyrmions have been observed and studied in multiple material systems, and the underlying magnetic textures are well established.",
        "uncertainties": [
